{"id":"n16219-2-6","stage":2,"title":"간판 · 名义","scene":"居住与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n16219-2-6-1","ko":"이 식당은 어떤 음식이 맛있나요?","zh":"这家餐厅什么好吃？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"식당은","meaning":"饭店，餐厅","explanation":"식당：饭店，餐厅；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"식당","audio":"/audio/fe047fb6c566f2771257.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36693","senseId":"2","lemma":"식당","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어떤","meaning":"什么样的，怎么样的","explanation":"어떤：什么样的，怎么样的","readings":[{"term":"어떤","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17185","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"음식이","meaning":"饮食，饭菜","explanation":"음식：饮食，饭菜；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"음식","audio":"/audio/2e144916046c2a6fc7df.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71114","senseId":"1","lemma":"음식","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"맛있나요?","meaning":"好吃，可口，香","explanation":"맛있다：好吃，可口，香；나요：礼貌、委婉地询问。","readings":[{"term":"맛있다","audio":"/audio/21e91ac8a208ff9e520a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70811","senseId":"1","lemma":"맛있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这，这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"71687","definition":"用于指示与话者离得近的物品，或用于指示话者所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"fe047fb6c566f277","term":"식당","zh":"饭店，餐厅","audio":"/audio/fe047fb6c566f2771257.mp3","entryId":"36693","definition":"制做并出售食物的商店。","pronunciation":["식땅"]},{"id":"a0307911a0fb4256","term":"어떤","zh":"什么样的，怎么样的","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3","entryId":"17185","definition":"用于询问人或事物的特征、内容、性格、性质、模样等。","pronunciation":["어떤"]},{"id":"2e144916046c2a6f","term":"음식","zh":"饮食，饭菜","audio":"/audio/2e144916046c2a6fc7df.mp3","entryId":"71114","definition":"饭、汤等人们每顿食用的东西。","pronunciation":["음ː식"]},{"id":"21e91ac8a208ff9e","term":"맛있다","zh":"好吃，可口，香","audio":"/audio/21e91ac8a208ff9e520a.mp3","entryId":"70811","definition":"食物的味道好。","pronunciation":["마딛따","마싣따"]}],"audio":"/audio/90d18cccff573942fca9.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n16219-2-6-2","ko":"삼계탕이 간판 메뉴이니 꼭 드셔 보세요.","zh":"参鸡汤是招牌菜，请一定尝尝。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"삼계탕이","meaning":"参鸡汤","explanation":"삼계탕：参鸡汤；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"삼계탕","audio":"/audio/b7d82f76f0f888475dbd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14582","senseId":"1","lemma":"삼계탕","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"간판","meaning":"名义，幌子","explanation":"간판：名义，幌子","readings":[{"term":"간판","audio":"/audio/7ff35dd4d547971e91e1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16219","senseId":"2","lemma":"간판","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"메뉴이니","meaning":"菜品","explanation":"메뉴：菜品；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"메뉴","audio":"/audio/13b36d6d0ccc7f4960aa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57299","senseId":"2","lemma":"메뉴","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"꼭","meaning":"一定，必定","explanation":"꼭：一定，必定","readings":[{"term":"꼭","audio":"/audio/712da780b7ecf8b736b3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"48064","senseId":"1","lemma":"꼭","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"드셔","meaning":"用餐、吃或喝（敬语）","explanation":"들다：用餐、吃或喝（敬语）；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"들다","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57293","senseId":"3","lemma":"들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보세요.","meaning":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","explanation":"보다：试着做（-아/어 보다）；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"8","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"b7d82f76f0f88847","term":"삼계탕","zh":"参鸡汤",